# Situation Generator

**SoT:** [`docs/02-product/solenos-situation-generator.md`](../../docs/02-product/solenos-situation-generator.md)

## Ask

**What situation is this caregiver living through?** — not “what information is in this message?”

## Pipeline

Extraction → **Situation generation** → Relationship mapping → Uncertainty → Human response

## Every input produces (internal)

Care recipient · current concern · observed changes · related events/decisions · possible links · unknowns · engine confidence

## Never

Fact-list summaries · “You mentioned…” · task lists · diagnosis / dementia progression / invented causation

**Module:** `src/lib/care-reality-intelligence/situation-generator.ts` · **Verify:** `verify:situation-generator`
